.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK SPRINT STATS"
.SH NAME
hamstik sprint stats \- Compute a client\-side aggregate summary of Work Items in the sprint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik sprint stats [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compute a client\-side aggregate summary of Work Items in the sprint
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I SPRINT
Sprint id (UUID; positional)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --all
Follow all pages (default: one page only)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --limit
Maximum total items to aggregate (distinct from the server page size)
.TP
.B --cursor
Opaque cursor returned by a preceding page
